{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Do not swallow VM-fatal failures inside Workflow Insight.** This and the similar hook/export/scheduler catches consume `VirtualMachineError` and `ThreadDeath`, so they never reach `PluginRunner`; a terminated or corrupted worker may continue and the invocation may return success. Unwrap failures, rethrow VM errors and `ThreadDeath`, and propagate async exporter fatals through the scheduler futures to the invocation hook. Add direct and wrapped fatal tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc752B7i","finding_digest":"b8c660e7d0bbc9de1b7dbe5ed430fd95d2a45906e2c9d260a4ed4a7a48ec0b30","finding_id":"arf_v1_xddgbz6qxpe54g35xzpnimh5sx","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflow-insight::throwable-containment::fatal-error-propagation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflow-insight::throwable-containment::fatal-error-propagation","line":195,"observation_digest":"f2539c886df382840f0772be69a1e42f9536956c825ccbbd45de4f0fa4c3460c","observation_id":"aro_v1_6jjzzcdn6obiidyhok7gtipef6","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/InsightPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T05:01:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tprwconlucqr6zinis3z7ectdr","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"88f55580001cbe2adc74245fc412b6b7f49068ac","reviewer":"codex","start_line":195,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_ttdtwjea3rvhwn3x2iovxzvitp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T05:01:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
